# Must-fail mutant for the session-store availability specification (T48,
# task T12's own patch, design.md §8.11).
#
# **Finding, surfaced rather than silently worked around: T12's own paired
# specification does not exist in this tree.** T12 (prover) was scoped to
# write "the session-store availability specification" — a spec asserting
# `has_legacy_invoices` on the recorded FALSE self capture and on the
# derived TRUE record installed via `overrideSelf("get-self-case-has-
# legacy-invoices")`. `grep -rln has_legacy_invoices
# packages/headless/src/modules/session-store/__tests__/` finds only the
# fixture file — no spec in the session-store test folder asserts the field
# at all. This patch is authored anyway, per the developer-seat law that
# mutants are authored ahead of the proof that exercises them — grade it
# once T12 lands. It is filed in the session-store test folder because
# that is where its (missing) paired spec belongs, not beside a file that
# does not exist.
#
# Mutates `mapSessionUser` in `session-store.mappers.ts` — the one D-15
# passthrough line — to read `client.staged_import` instead of
# `client.has_legacy_invoices`.
#
# Reds: this control is LIVE, not dead — it bites in the legacy-invoices
# module, not in session-store's own suite. Within `pnpm --filter
# @upmind-automation/headless test:integration session-store` alone it reds
# NOTHING (74/74 stay green, verified) because the gap above still holds:
# no session-store spec asserts `has_legacy_invoices`. But the same mutant
# reddens `legacy-invoices.collection.int.test.ts`'s AC-5 specification —
# "@AC-5 reports itself available when the client record carries an
# imported-invoice history" (`hasLegacyInvoices` at line 119) — exactly as
# design.md §8.11 predicts, because the module's `hasLegacyInvoices` reads
# the session record's passthrough field, which this patch corrupts
# upstream. Verified: no OTHER legacy-invoices integration or unit
# specification reddens.
#
# Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.
--- a/packages/headless/src/modules/session-store/session-store.mappers.ts
+++ b/packages/headless/src/modules/session-store/session-store.mappers.ts
@@ -78,5 +78,5 @@
